## Interface: 30300
## Title: heroPanel
## Author: herodope
## Version: 0.2.0
## Notes: Skin, mover and lock controls for the objective tracker and the Mythic+ tracker.
## SavedVariables: HEROPANEL_DB
## OptionalDeps: Ascension_MythicPlus, SharedMediaAdditionalFonts, SharedMedia_Causese
## X-Website: https://github.com/herodope/heroPanel
## X-Category: Quests & Leveling
## X-Embeds: LibStub, CallbackHandler-1.0, LibSharedMedia-3.0
## DefaultState: enabled

# Embedded libraries. LibStub keeps one instance per major version and the
# highest minor wins, so if the player already has a newer LibSharedMedia these
# are no-ops and heroPanel uses theirs - which is how fonts registered by other
# addons turn up in the font dropdown. See libs/README.md.
libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua
libs\CallbackHandler-1.0\CallbackHandler-1.0.lua
libs\LibSharedMedia-3.0\LibSharedMedia-3.0.lua

Core.lua
Util.lua
Media.lua
Plate.lua
Trackers.lua
Move.lua
Skin.lua
Lines.lua
Mplus.lua
Keys.lua
Options.lua
Compat.lua
